  "title": "GUARDIAN",
  "text": "Guardian is Malaysia’s leading health, beauty, and personal care chain, trusted by customers for offering high-quality products at great value. Over five decades of commitment and service have solidified this trust, beginning with the very first Guardian store, a modest 200 square feet at The Weld, Kuala Lumpur, 57 years ago.\n\nToday, Guardian operates more than 600 stores across high streets, popular shopping malls, and through our e-commerce platform. We serve an average of 33 million customers per year who value our extensive range of quality pharmaceutical, health, and beauty products. Many of these products are exclusive to guardian, and we continue to innovate for an enhanced shopping experience.",
